  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Phy 102.04 \"Physical therapy\" means \"physical therapy\" as defined in RSA 328-A:2, IX, namely, \"the care and services provided by or under the direction and supervision of a physical therapist who is licensed pursuant to this chapter.\"\n\nSource. #9039, eff 11-28-07; ss by #12993, eff 2-22-20 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Phy 100); ss by #14385, eff 9-23-25 (formerly Phy 102.03)",
